    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "HTTP surface — 7 routers, 98 handlers",
      "items": [
        "api/app.py includes journeys, turn, misc, account, admin, llm and evals; it also mounts frontend/dist at /.",
        "turn.py: POST /api/turn/stream; sse_frame() writes event + JSON; 11 turn events (intake, route, clarify, progress, agent, plan, proposal, token, trace, done, error).",
        "journeys.py (27 routes): create, state, revisions, itinerary, proposal decision, lock/booked, finalise, share, import, delete.",
        "account.py (10), llm.py (8), misc.py (11), admin.py (32), evals.py (9); 98 route handlers produce 86 OpenAPI paths.",
        "deps.py: X-Client-Token guest, Bearer account, X-Admin-Token/local admin; one seat per session per turn.",
        "frontend/src/lib/api.ts exposes 70 request paths; usePathfinder.ts consumes route, progress, agent, clarify, plan, proposal, token, trace, done and error.",
        "views.py is a helper module (session_view, segments, calendar ICS, translate_plan, runtime_config), not a router."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Turn control — mask, read, route, gate",
      "items": [
        "_produce(): mask_pii first; load context + plan + last 10 messages; write user row; held-session short circuit.",
        "_intake(): files (pypdf) and URLs become IntakeFacts only when a file or link is present.",
        "understand(): one purpose=understand JSON call into ParsedIntent; merge_slots copies untouched context and clamps days 1–60, party 1–40.",
        "_route(): threshold 0.8; unclear always clarifies; a low-confidence modify on an existing plan becomes a clarify; affected_parts defaults to attraction/hotel/weather on plan.",
        "Optional Jev: TURN_ORCHESTRATOR=jev overrides intent only when Jev confidence ≥ threshold; analyst slots are kept.",
        "Gates before dispatch: injection count, self-harm reply, handoff phrases/frustration/stuck, finalised plan refuses plan/modify."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Plan path — gather, compose, validate, repair",
      "items": [
        "gather(): attraction, hotel, weather, flight and route work runs concurrently; a failed source becomes DataGap, never a guessed fact.",
        "candidate_pool(): stable refs (pl-, x-, wiki-, hotel-) are all the composer sees; it cannot write an address, price or hour.",
        "compose(): purpose=plan, 12k cap, PlanDraft → build_plan copies Evidence into PlanItem, settles overlaps/transfers, hotel, tickets, alternatives and budget.",
        "validate_structure(): required fields, known refs, day integrity; repair loops MAX_REPAIRS (default 2) with previous problems fed back.",
        "audit_constraints(): purpose=verify into VerifyResult; failed or unknown checks become repair problems; one extra compose attempt.",
        "Fallbacks: one composer retry on LLMError, then fallback_plan() from the sourced shortlist; _persist_plan writes the next version and SSE plan + reply."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Modify path — typed ops and proposals",
      "items": [
        "Scoped gather first, then propose_edit(): purpose=edit, EditDraft with ops (move, retime, add, replace, swap_hotel, set_field, remove).",
        "needs_research: lookup_place() (Google Places live, Wikipedia offline) adds a source before the edit is asked again.",
        "Draft scope=whole or a date/destination change returns rebuild=True; orchestrator calls _plan_turn instead of applying a small edit.",
        "Locked and confirmed items are protected; untouched items keep their data; diff_plans() describes the change.",
        "review=true is the default: the candidate plan is stored as a proposal; only decide_proposal(accept) persists it.",
        "No change bumps the stuck counter; at 3 failed edits the chat can hand off to the Desk queue."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Ask + clarify paths — no plan mutation",
      "items": [
        "Ask: _search_queries() (purpose=search_query) → up to 2 SerpAPI searches × 4 results; payload = trip + plan text + history + sources + cost.",
        "Ask streams llm.stream_text(purpose=ask) as token events, then _guard_output + mask_pii; no plan version is written.",
        "Clarify: route.need_clarification or a plan missing destination/dates; _clarify() builds question + slots + labels + options + choices + suggestions.",
        "Clarify emits event=clarify and a short chat line, saves the assistant message, and returns without evidence or plan work.",
        "Both paths end through _finish(): trace event, done event, session note; ask resets the stuck counter."
      ]
