      "items": [
        "SQLite WAL has 12 tables: sessions, contexts, messages, plans, shares, profiles, wishlist, eval_runs, users, feedback, kv, seats.",
        "Plans are append-only (session_id, version); restore copies an old version forward; one seat row prevents two turns on one session.",
        "PII: HKID, phone, email, card (Luhn) masked before the model/store; runtime patterns editable in the admin preview.",
        "Canary checked on every output; a leak becomes a refusal. Injection is recorded as a threat and the message stays data.",
        "Eval: 7 suites (routing 84, injection 84, hongkong 8, japan 6, travelplanner 3, efficiency 10, edit_vs_replan 5) run the real pipeline with sandbox evidence.",
